// Public client-side variables (safe to expose)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=your-project-url
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key

# IMPORTANT SECURITY NOTICE:
# Do NOT prefix any private or service keys with VITE_.
# Anything starting with VITE_ is bundled to the browser and public.
#
# NEVER put these client-side:
# - SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY
# - RESEND_API_KEY
# - OPENAI_API_KEY
# - LOVABLE_API_KEY
# - Any third-party private API keys
#
# Store private keys only in server-side environments (Supabase Edge Functions)
# using project environment variables (Deno.env.get(...)) and enforce auth in functions.